===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|осень}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*esenь}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*(s)h₁es-|*h₁es-en-}}, whence English {{m|en|earn}} and German {{m|de|Ernte||harvest}}.

{{doublet|ru|есень|есеня}}, cognate with {{cog|be|во́сень}} and {{cog|uk|о́сінь}}.

